From: bendy2 (ported to 610.x)
Subject: CMP 90HX compute unlock via V67 PLM exploit

Port of bendy2's CMP 90HX compute unlock patch from 580.x to 610.57.04.
Uses V67 (Booter Load) to open FEAT_OVR_PLM, then writes the speed selectors
SS0=0x88888888 SS1=0x00000008 to unlock full compute performance.

Gadget addresses updated for 610.x GSP firmware:
- 0x00000d44 -> 0x00000d2a (LW x18,-384(x13))
- 0x00001fce -> 0x0000209c (AUIPC)
- 0x00000d52 -> 0x00000d38 (offset)

